frontend
.git
env

# Developer artifacts that must never ship into image layers — otherwise
# host paths baked into Gradle's build/ and .gradle/ state trip up
# composite build registration inside the container.
**/.gradle
**/build
**/.kotlin
**/node_modules
**/.yarn/cache
**/.yarn/install-state.gz
# `**/target` is intentionally absent: no subproject uses Maven, and
# a `target` directory exists under sync/ as a legitimate Kotlin
# package (services/api/.../sync/target/contact/...).

# IDE / OS scratch
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
